People's Daily Commentator: A Good Start for the "14th Five-Year Plan" – An Analysis of Learning and Implementing the Spirit of the Central Economic Work Conference - Xinhua News Agency
Xinhua News Agency, Beijing, December 11, 12th, Commentator Article from People's Daily: A Good Start for the "14th Five-Year Plan" – An Analysis of Learning and Implementing the Spirit of the Central Economic Work Conference
"Realized a good start to the '14th Five-Year Plan', " the central economic work conference held from December 8 to 10 highly evaluated the achievements made in the country's socio-economic development over the past year.
Xi Jinping delivered an important speech at the meeting, summarizing in depth the economic work of 2021, deeply analyzing the current economic situation, and making major arrangements for 2022 economic work. His remarks pointed the way forward and provided fundamental guidance for us to do our economic work next year and to welcome the successful convening of the 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China.
We celebrate with great enthusiasm the centenary of the founding of the Communist Party of China, officially declaring the comprehensive building of a moderately prosperous society and the accomplishment of the first centenary goal, and embarking on a new journey to comprehensively build a modern socialist country and advance toward the second centenary goal.
We convened the Sixth Plenary Session of the 19th CPC Central Committee to summarize major achievements and historical experiences of the Party’s century-long struggle, passing the third historical resolution in the Party’s history, “Resolution of the CPC Central Committee on Major Achievements and Historical Experience of the Party’s Century-Long Struggle.” This is a political declaration by contemporary Chinese Communists to remember their original aspiration and founding mission and to uphold and develop socialism with Chinese characteristics, and it is also a guide for action to draw lessons from history, forge ahead, and realize the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.
In the past year, the complex and severe external environment has been influenced by the interweaving of the century-level changes in the world and the global pandemic of COVID-19, with domestic tasks of COVID-19 prevention and control as well as economic and social development being extremely heavy and arduous.
Under the leadership of the Communist Party of China with Comrade Xi Jinping at its core, the central leadership has been coordinating domestic and international situations, adhering to a work tone of steady progress amid improvement, and calmly responding to both the century-scale changes and the global pandemic. It has been balancing epidemic prevention and control with economic and social development, accelerating the construction of a new development pattern, strengthening macro-policy cross-cycle regulation, focusing on promoting sustained and healthy economic development, deepening reform and innovation, and striving to complete arduous tasks in reform and development. As a result, major achievements have been made in all fields of Party and state endeavors.
A good start has been achieved during the "14th Five-Year Plan" period, with an important aspect being the new strides taken in establishing a new development pattern, and new achievements made in high-quality development.
China has maintained global leadership in economic development and epidemic prevention and control, showcasing characteristics of strong resilience, great potential, and ample momentum. Strategic scientific and technological power is growing stronger, with a steady stream of major innovative achievements, continuous improvements in its innovation capabilities, and breakthroughs made in key technology research and development. The strength of its industrial chain has been enhanced, foreign trade volumes have increased while quality has improved, the structure continues to be optimized, and new drivers of growth such as new industries, new business models, and new forms of employment continue to grow and expand. Deepening reforms and opening-up is advancing further, efforts are being made to clear up bottlenecks that hinder supply-demand alignment and the flow of factors, and China is creating new advantages through high-level opening-up. Robust measures have been taken for social protection, employment scales continue to expand, residents’ incomes have grown in tandem with GDP growth, annual grain output has consistently remained above 1.3 trillion catties over the past seven years, bringing about another “eighteen consecutive bountiful harvests”; Ecological civilization construction is ongoing, work on achieving peak carbon and net-zero emissions is advancing in an integrated manner, progress is being made in green and low-carbon transitions, and new
These achievements are the result of the strong leadership of the Communist Party of China under Comrade Xi Jinping, the scientific guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, and the joint efforts of the entire party, the country, and all ethnic groups.
Practice has proven once again that the Party's establishment of Comrade Xi Jinping as the core of the Central Committee and the whole Party, and the establishment of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era as the guiding ideology, possess decisive significance for the development of the cause of the Party and the country in the new era, and for advancing the historical process of national rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.
With Comrade Xi Jinping as the core of the Party Central Committee and the core of the whole Party leading and steering the ship, with scientific guidance from Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, with the unity and indomitable efforts of the entire Party, throughout the country, and all ethnic groups, we will certainly be able to overcome all difficulties and obstacles on our path towards building a socialist modernized country comprehensively. This will allow us to create new glories of our times and achieve new great endeavors in history.
The 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China will be held next year, which is a major political event in terms of the Party and the country.
Promoting the great founding spirit of the Party, upholding the work tone of steady progress amid advancement, fully, accurately, and comprehensively implementing the new development philosophy, accelerating the construction of a new development pattern, comprehensively deepening reforms and opening-up, upholding innovation-driven development, promoting high-quality development, taking supply-side structural reform as the main line, coordinating epidemic prevention and control with economic and social development, coordinating development with security, continuing to do well in the “six stabilities” and “six guarantees,” continuously improving people’s livelihood, striving to stabilize the macroeconomic situation, keeping the economy within a reasonable range, maintaining social stability, we will certainly maintain a stable and healthy economic environment, a harmonious and safe social environment, and a clean and upright political environment, and present excellent achievements for the successful convening of the 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China.
Let us more closely unite around the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China with Comrade Xi Jinping at its core, enhance our “four consciousnesses,” uphold our “four self-confidences,” and practice our “two maintenances,” constantly improving our political judgment, political understanding, and political execution capabilities, so as to implement the decisions and deployments of the Party Central Committee in actual actions, and advance socialism with Chinese characteristics in the new era continuously.
