Chairman of the Bosnian Olympic Committee: Believes China has the capability to host the Winter Olympics successfully during special times - Xinhua News Agency
Xinhua Salajevo, December 11 – Chairman of the Bosnian Olympic Committee Kvesic recently stated that the Bosnian side is very much looking forward to the Beijing Winter Olympics and firmly believes China has the capability to host this Winter Sports Festival in a special period.
Recently, Chinese Ambassador to Bosnia and Herzegovina Qi Ping met with BiH Olympic Committee President Kvesic at the Sarajevo Olympic Center.
During the meeting, Kvesic positively assessed the Sino-Bosnian relationship and stated that he had visited China during the Beijing Summer Olympics in 2008, where he was deeply impressed by the excellent organizing work of the Chinese side, and believed that China has the capability to host the Winter Games successfully in exceptional circumstances. The Bosnian side is very excited about the Beijing Winter Olympics, and the Bosnian Olympic Committee is actively organizing participation. They hope to use this opportunity to further broaden their cooperation and exchanges in sports with China.
Qianping noted that there is a special "Olympic bond" between the two countries.
The 1984 Sarajevo Winter Olympics were held here successfully, and just two months from now, the 2022 Beijing Winter Olympics will kick off, presenting the world with a simple, safe, and spectacular event.
Looking forward to deepening mutual cooperation in winter sports events preparation, athlete training, and other aspects between the two countries. The Chinese Embassy in Bosnia and Herzegovina is willing to continue playing its role as a bridge to facilitate such exchanges, with the Beijing Winter Olympics as an opportunity, to promote ever-deepening cultural and people-to-people exchanges between the two nations, so that their peoples "look towards the future together," and wishes the Bosnian sports stars success in Beijing.
Before the meeting, the Bosnian Olympic Committee held a ceremony to award the "Best Athlete of the Year" for the Tenth Edition, where Qian Ping was a special guest who presented the award to the best young athlete in Bosnia and Herzegovina.
The promotional video for the Beijing Winter Olympics was played repeatedly at the event site.
