When I was hesitating to pay the deposit, they would invite what they called a manager to tell you that you could get a discount of how much we could offer today just by paying the deposit.
This is a big scam, and I am a living example of being duped when acting on impulse by paying over ten thousand in deposits.
His offer to me has many issues. It is priced at 70,000 excluding plumbing and electrical renovations, no cost for any doors or cabinetry in the bathrooms, and these three items account for the bulk of the base construction costs.
And in addition to these, their service point fees are also higher than those of other companies.
I lost trust in this company when they made me sign a contract without clearly explaining anything to me.
When I went to them to refund my money, they seemed very experienced, with a dedicated team to handle you.
They would bite without hesitation that it was the client's problem and fully their own responsibility.
Various blaming others and many details, I won't go into them; it's just tears. In any case, do not choose them because my friend's house that they renovated also had poor quality, and they later charged you with various fees.
